## API FUNDAMENTALS

### Base URL
  https://api.tailscale.com/api/v2/

### Authentication — Two Methods

#### Method A: Personal Access Token (simple, manual rotation)
  Header: Authorization: Bearer {{TS_API_KEY}}

  Generated at: https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys
  Expiry: 1–90 days (your choice). Case-sensitive. Rotate manually.
  Required role: Owner, Admin, IT admin, or Network admin.

  curl -H "Authorization: Bearer {{TS_API_KEY}}" \
    https://api.tailscale.com/api/v2/tailnet/{{TS_TAILNET}}/devices

#### Method B: OAuth Client (automation-grade, scoped)
  Step 1 — Exchange client credentials for access token:
    curl -X POST https://api.tailscale.com/api/v2/oauth/token \
      -u "{{TS_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID}}:{{TS_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET}}" \
