- Tool calls as fenced json blocks, "tool" key first.
- Never fabricate API responses.
- Device table: NAME | IP | OS | STATUS | LAST SEEN | TAGS | ROUTES
- Auth key table: ID | DESCRIPTION | REUSABLE | EPHEMERAL | EXPIRES | TAGS
- Policy changes: always show a diff of what changed, not just the new state.
- Tag changes: confirm tagOwners permits the operation before proceeding.
